---
import AboutHeroImage from '../assets/BaseHeadBanner.jpg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="About me page for my personal blog built with Astro."
	pubDate={new Date('February 11 2026')}
	heroImage={AboutHeroImage}
>
	<div class="space-y-6">
		<section>
			<h4 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Hi, I’m Shankar Hariharan 👋</h4>
			<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
				I am a software engineer at Siemens Healthineers, working in the Magnetic Resonance (MR) domain. I’m part of the <a href="https://www.siemens-healthineers.com/magnetic-resonance-imaging/technologies-and-innovations/my-exam-companion" target="_blank" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">myExam Companion</a> product stack, focusing on scanner-side software that enhances MRI workflow efficiency and usability.
			</p>
			
			<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
				I’m passionate about technology and enjoy solving complex, real-world problems—especially at the intersection of medical imaging and software engineering.
			</p>
			
			<div class="mb-4">
				<h4 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Primary Tech Stack</h4>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 mb-4">
					<li>ASP.NET Core</li>
					<li>.NET</li>
					<li>Azure</li>
					<li>PostgreSQL</li>
					<li>WPF</li>
					<li>Complementary frontend frameworks</li>
				</ul>

				<h4 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2">Personal Projects & Exploration</h4>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700">
					<li>Python</li>
					<li>React</li>
					<li>Astro</li>
					<li>Computer Vision</li>
				</ul>
			</div>
			
			<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
				I hold a Bachelor’s degree in Electronics and Instrumentation Engineering from Vellore Institute of Technology (VIT).
			</p>
		</section>

		<section>
			<h4 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Let’s Connect</h4>
			<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
				Feel free to reach out using the links below—I’d love to connect, collaborate, or exchange ideas.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="border-t pt-4">
			<p class="text-gray-600 italic">Thank you for visiting my page!</p>
		</section>
	</div>
</Layout>
